# SYNOPSIS

```text
protocol vectraos.audio.lease.Lease version 1
call lend() throws(LeaseError) -> Lent
call clock() throws(LeaseError) -> Clock
```

# DESCRIPTION

Protocol `vectraos.audio.lease.Lease`, version 1, of library `AudioLeaseIPC`, its messages in the one wire format (wire(6)).

| Method | Kind | Since | Ordinal |
| `lend` | call | 1 | `0x1c8876ed4643e67b` |
| `clock` | call | 1 | `0x7a42c00fd3bb6338` |

: `lend`
  The playback stream, lent: its buffer, made silence, and its
  layout. The stream starts at once and runs until the channel
  closes; the lessee writes each period `lead` ahead of the device.
: `clock`
  The lent stream's counter.

